 - Pay Attention - Left on Chiles Pope Valley Rd - Left into Moore Creek Pa
 rk past a private house on a very narrow road there is a large parking lot
 .\nGive yourself plenty of time to arrive. It's often farther than you thi
 nk.\n\n**The Hike (Group Hike #344)**\nChiles Creek\, Whiskey Ridge\, Conn
  Peak and Shoreline trails\, - a lollipop hike\nAllTrails Map -\nhttps://w
 ww.alltrails.com/explore/recording/lake-hennessey-e70981f\nDistance - 6 mi
 les/9.7 kilometers\nElevation change - 900 feet/274 meters\nDifficulty - 6
